<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-SWITZERLAND BEAT HUNGARY 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWITZERLAND BEAT HUNGARY 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland beat Hungary 1-0 in their European group three World Cup qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Kubilay Turkyilmaz 83</p>
<p>Attendance: 17,300</p>
<p>	Standings	  P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts </p>
<p> 1. Norway		 4   3   1   0  10   1  10</p>
<p> 2. Switzerland	  4   2   0   2   4   4   6</p>
<p> 3. Hungary		4   2   0   2   4   4   6</p>
<p> 3. Finland		4   1   1   2   5   6   4</p>
<p> 5. Azerbaijan	   4   1   0   3   2  10   3</p>
